---
layout: broadcast.njk
title: Home
description: Kevin Franz Jr. - 6'1" SG/SF at Shawnee Mission West. Class of 2028. College basketball + atmospheric science.
active: home
---

{# ===== HERO ===== #}
<section class="b-hero">
  <div class="b-hero-jersey-num">{{ player.jersey or "30" }}</div>
  <div class="b-hero-grid">
    <div class="b-hero-left">
      <div>
        <div class="b-hero-eyebrow">
          <span>CLASS OF {{ player.class or "2028" }}</span>
          <span>SG/SF</span>
          <span>{{ player.location | upper }}</span>
        </div>
        <h1>
          <span>Kevin Franz</span>
          <span class="b-stroke">Junior.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="b-hero-sub">
          {{ player.height }} / {{ player.weight }} lb guard-forward at {{ player.highSchool }}. Pace, playmaking, and full-court defense &mdash; chasing college basketball and a degree in atmospheric science.
        </p>
        <div class="b-hero-cta-row">
          <a href="/basketball/" class="b-btn-primary">View Profile &rarr;</a>
          <a href="/contact/" class="b-btn-ghost">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:16px; margin-top:32px; font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.1em; color:var(--b-mute); text-transform:uppercase;">
        <span style="color:var(--b-green-bright);">&bull; JC HOOPS 16U</span>
        <span>10-3</span>
        <span>8.2 PPG</span>
        <span>5.5 RPG</span>
        <span>2.8 APG</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="b-hero-image">
      <img src="/images/player/medium_Copy_of_618_A3075_2_Enhanced_NR_0a0a68195a.jpg" alt="{{ player.name }}">
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="b-hero-stat-strip">
    {% set heroStats = [
      ['HT', player.height],
      ['WT', player.weight],
      ['POS', player.position],
      ['#', player.jersey],
      ['GPA', player.gpa],
      ['CLASS', "'" + (player.class | replace('20','')) ]
    ] %}
    {% for cell in heroStats %}
      <div class="b-stat-cell">
        <div class="b-stat-cell-label">{{ cell[0] }}</div>
        <div class="b-stat-cell-value">{{ cell[1] }}</div>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== PILLARS ===== #}
<div class="b-section-head">
  <div class="b-section-head-left">
    <span class="b-section-tag">/01 PILLARS</span>
    <h2 class="b-section-title">Three<br>at once.</h2>
  </div>
  <a href="#about" class="b-section-cta">VIEW ALL &rarr;</a>
</div>
<section class="b-pillars">
  <div class="b-pillar">
    <div class="b-pillar-tag">/ BASKETBALL</div>
    <h3>Guard /<br>forward.</h3>
    <p>#{{ player.jersey or "28" }} &mdash; Pace, decisions, on-ball defense. JV 2025&ndash;26: 5.6 PPG &middot; 4.0 RPG (1st) &middot; 2.5 APG &middot; 2.18 AST/TO.</p>
    <a href="/basketball/" class="b-pillar-link">Full profile</a>
  </div>
  <div class="b-pillar">
    <div class="b-pillar-tag">/ ACADEMICS</div>
    <h3>{{ player.gpa or "3.85" }} GPA.</h3>
    <p>Heavy load in math and science at {{ player.highSchool }}. Plan to study meteorology / atmospheric science.</p>
    <a href="/academics/" class="b-pillar-link">Coursework</a>
  </div>
  <div class="b-pillar">
    <div class="b-pillar-tag">/ CHARACTER</div>
    <h3>Off the<br>floor.</h3>
    <p>Weather nerd, film-room junkie, and mentor to younger players. Leadership, family, and showing up.</p>
    <a href="/character/" class="b-pillar-link">More</a>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== ABOUT — full-bleed image w/ overlay panel ===== #}
<section id="about" style="position:relative; height:600px; overflow:hidden; border-bottom:1px solid var(--b-line);">
  <img src="/images/banner/large_Copy_of_618_A3237_2_Enhanced_NR_8707ac32b4.jpg" alt="Kevin in action" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover;">
  <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; background:linear-gradient(90deg, var(--b-bg) 0%, rgba(11,13,16,0.7) 40%, transparent 70%);"></div>
  <div style="position:absolute; top:0; left:0; bottom:0; width:560px; max-width:92%; padding:72px 48px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center;">
    <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.14em; color:var(--b-green-bright); text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:16px;">/02 PROFILE</div>
    <h2 style="font-family:'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight:900; font-size:56px; line-height:0.95; letter-spacing:-0.03em; text-transform:uppercase; margin:0; color:var(--b-text);">
      A guard who<br>plays the<br>
      <span style="-webkit-text-stroke:2px var(--b-green-bright); -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;">right way.</span>
    </h2>
    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:var(--b-mute); margin-top:24px; max-width:440px;">
      On the floor I'm a pace-pusher and playmaker &mdash; creating for teammates, defending full court, making the right read under pressure. Off the floor I'm just as serious about the classroom, with weather and atmospheric science driving my long-term goals.
    </p>
    <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--b-line); padding-top:20px; margin-top:32px; font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--b-text);">
      &ldquo;Help my team win. Earn the chance to play college ball.&rdquo;
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ===== TIMELINE PREVIEW (static — full interactive timeline lives at /timeline/) ===== #}
<div class="b-section-head">
  <div class="b-section-head-left">
    <span class="b-section-tag">/03 JOURNEY</span>
    <h2 class="b-section-title">Seven years<br>on the floor.</h2>
  </div>
  <a href="/timeline/" class="b-section-cta">FULL TIMELINE &rarr;</a>
</div>
{# Stages come from each entry's existing "season" field. The trailing
   "Other" group is a safety net so no entry can ever be dropped. #}
{% set journeyStages = [
  { label: 'Elementary',                 match: 'Elementary' },
  { label: 'Middle School &middot; School Ball', match: 'Middle School' },
  { label: 'Middle School &middot; AAU',         match: '__unassigned__' },
  { label: 'High School &middot; School Ball',   match: 'High School' },
  { label: 'High School &middot; AAU',           match: 'AAU' }
] %}
{% set journeyShown = [] %}
{% for stage in journeyStages %}
  {% set stageItems = [] %}
  {% for item in collections.timeline %}
    {% if item.data.season == stage.match %}
      {% set _ = stageItems.push(item) %}
      {% set _ = journeyShown.push(item.url) %}
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
  <div style="padding:14px 48px; background:var(--b-bg-2); border-top:1px solid var(--b-line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--b-line); font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--b-green-bright);">
    {{ stage.label | safe }}
  </div>
  <section class="b-pillars" style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap;">
    {% for item in stageItems %}
      <div class="b-pillar" style="min-height:0; flex:1 1 280px;">
        <div class="b-pillar-tag">{{ item.data.year }}</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:18px;">{{ item.data.team or item.data.grade }}</h3>
        <p>{{ item.data.summary | default('') | truncate(110) }}</p>
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <div class="b-pillar" style="min-height:0; flex:1 1 280px;">
        <div class="b-pillar-tag">&mdash;</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:18px;">Details coming soon</h3>
        <p>Nothing recorded here yet.</p>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
{% endfor %}
{% set journeyOther = [] %}
{% for item in collections.timeline %}
  {% if item.url not in journeyShown %}{% set _ = journeyOther.push(item) %}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if journeyOther | length %}
  <div style="padding:14px 48px; background:var(--b-bg-2); border-top:1px solid var(--b-line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--b-line); font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--b-green-bright);">
    Other
  </div>
  <section class="b-pillars" style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap;">
    {% for item in journeyOther %}
      <div class="b-pillar" style="min-height:0; flex:1 1 280px;">
        <div class="b-pillar-tag">{{ item.data.year }}</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:18px;">{{ item.data.team or item.data.grade }}</h3>
        <p>{{ item.data.summary | default('') | truncate(110) }}</p>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
{% endif %}

{# ===== RECENT UPDATES ===== #}
<div class="b-section-head">
  <div class="b-section-head-left">
    <span class="b-section-tag">/04 LATEST</span>
    <h2 class="b-section-title">Recent<br>updates.</h2>
  </div>
  <a href="/updates/" class="b-section-cta">ALL UPDATES &rarr;</a>
</div>
<section class="b-pillars">
  {% set recentUpdates = collections.updates | reverse | limit(3) %}
  {% for post in recentUpdates %}
    <div class="b-pillar">
      <div class="b-pillar-tag">{{ post.data.type or 'UPDATE' }}</div>
      <h3 style="font-size:22px;">{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
      <p>
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}" style="display:block; color:var(--b-green-bright); font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:8px;">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        {{ post.data.summary }}
      </p>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="b-pillar-link">Read more</a>
    </div>
  {% endfor %}
</section>

{# ===== CTA / CONTACT ===== #}
<section style="padding:80px 48px; background:var(--b-bg); border-bottom:1px solid var(--b-line);">
  <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:64px; align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.14em; color:var(--b-green-bright); text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:16px;">/05 CONTACT</div>
      <h2 style="font-family:'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight:900; font-size:64px; line-height:0.95; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:-0.03em; margin:0;">
        For<br>coaches.
      </h2>
      <p style="font-size:16px; color:var(--b-mute); margin-top:24px; max-width:440px;">
        Highlights, stats, and full recruiting profiles live on the Basketball page. For direct inquiries, reach the family below.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;">
      <a href="mailto:{{ player.parentEmail }}" style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:24px 28px; background:var(--b-green); color:white; text-decoration:none; align-items:center; clip-path:polygon(2% 0, 100% 0, 98% 100%, 0% 100%);">
        <div>
          <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase; opacity:0.7; margin-bottom:6px;">EMAIL &rarr;</div>
          <div style="font-family:'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:22px;">{{ player.parentEmail }}</div>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="tel:{{ player.parentPhone }}" style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:24px 28px; background:var(--b-bg-2); border:1px solid var(--b-line); color:var(--b-text); text-decoration:none; align-items:center;">
        <div>
          <div style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--b-mute); margin-bottom:6px;">PHONE &rarr;</div>
          <div style="font-family:'Archivo', sans-serif; font-weight:800; font-size:22px;">{{ player.parentPhone }}</div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
